# November 20, 2026: northeastern Dutchess County: Pine Plains, Stanford (Bangall and Attlebury), North East
# (Millerton and Coleman Station), Amenia (the hamlet, Leedsville, Amenia Union, Smithfield and Wassaic), and the Nine
# Partners meeting house at Millbrook. Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region hud; it offered Philmont,
